# PaperTrail

**A multi-tenant, citation-grounded Q&A service over research papers, built as a production-style RAG system and driven by evaluation.**

PaperTrail lets each tenant upload research-paper PDFs and ask questions about them. Every answer comes with page-level citations, and the system declines to answer when the retrieved evidence is too weak. Each design choice (chunking, hybrid retrieval, reranking, routing) is justified by a measured before/after result on a golden evaluation set.

> **Status:** In active development. Sections marked *(planned)* describe the target design. Results tables are filled in only with numbers I have measured myself.

